    <informations>Shelly 1L — mounting view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: SW1 SW2 Sx Sx N L O.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-1l
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_0ea49b189f53fe15b2e12d221d864ee98b56b34eaa13f95c6520daea122533ac/shelly1l.png?cb=9e6f7fbf43081d3f010825afc6759ad2
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_a63255b14202f69fc2cc397efe015e879cc357486ed096cf001a2886f09ee2b7/1L-internal-schematics.png?cb=42e77c4750b4757721d1a9cd5e4ac5e7
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_ea382da0b2439cac0f462856bf78828238dd26d146d95fb88c1dd88b04f2490e/Download%20printed%20user%20guide%20-%20English,%20Deutsch,%20Italiano,%20Espa%C3%B1ol,%20Portugu%C3%AAs,%20Fran%C3%A7ais?cb=0d438a3bab3918739475e7cdbdc920c2

Notes:
- Official product photo and wiring diagrams confirm two distinct Sx screw positions. Internal schematic has a repeated SW1 typo; photo and installation diagrams show SW1 then SW2.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
